# `node scripts/generate-icon.mjs` (Tauri's icon command) also writes sizes this app
# does not bundle. Only icon.ico, icon.png and tray.rgba are kept. icon.icns is a build
# product (its bytes differ on every run), so it is generated but not tracked.
/icon.icns
/android/
/ios/
/*x*.png
/Square*Logo.png
/StoreLogo.png
